    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>歌名：尘埃点点</span></p><span></span><p><span>歌词：清源er</span></p><span></span><p><span>曲唱：AI</span></p><span></span><p><span>......</span></p><span></span><p><span>我的世界里无所谓光的参与</span></p><span></span><p><span>时时刻刻 看得见 看不见</span></p><span></span><p><span>我都在舞 或是坠落</span></p><span></span><p><span>我总是和某些事物待在一起</span></p><span></span><p><span>又离开某些事物</span></p><span></span><p><span>你如果问我天气怎样</span></p><span></span><p><span>我想我会暗暗回答心情总是晴</span></p><span></span><p><span>好啦 我是骗你的 笨蛋</span></p><span></span><p><span>我和你一样</span></p><span></span><p><span>会被雨淋湿</span></p><span></span><p><span>会偶尔看见彩虹</span></p><span></span><p><span>也会做梦</span></p><span></span><p><span>要是我成为了你</span></p><span></span><p><span>你成为了我</span></p><span></span><p><span>睡之前 你还会想念着</span></p><span></span><p><span>你其实是我吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>好啦，大笨蛋</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们都是笨蛋</span></p><span></span><p><span>所以</span></p><span></span><p><span>一直做好朋友好吗</span></p><span></span><p><span>PS:想着我OOC，脱离当前我在这个世界的设定，变成......</span></p>]]></description>
