  <item>
    <title>星星漂流记：岛上急雨</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67c9ad5a0766616acd1a77b8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67c9ad5a0766616acd1a77b8</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 06 Mar 2025 14:14:39 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnuO8Q5LyJicRXIB9Td2-iJA2nga.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>今夜雨</span></p><span></span><p><span>城市的偏远处</span></p><span></span><p><span>没有霓虹灯</span></p><span></span><p><span>只有着许许多多</span></p><span></span><p><span>苦中作乐的心</span></p><span></span><p><span>那儿的人们</span></p><span></span><p><span>懂得怎么以生活的难</span></p><span></span><p><span>来宽慰灵魂的苦</span></p><span></span><p><span>一场急雨</span></p><span></span><p><span>在岛上落下</span></p><span></span><p><span>是人们心里的岛屿</span></p><span></span><p><span>突然降下的</span></p><span></span><p><span>是同一片海域的</span></p><span></span><p><span>曾经的精灵</span></p><span></span><p><span>它说着勿忘我</span></p><span></span><p><span>勿忘我</span></p><span></span><p><span>城市中心的人们游戏</span></p><span></span><p><span>笑着说：哪里有雨</span></p><span></span><p><span>殊不知冒着泡泡的啤酒杯里</span></p><span></span><p><span>曾掉落过被雨淋湿的</span></p><span></span><p><span>一颗真心</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵：</span></p><span></span><p><span>01.罗大佑 - 歌 (1995年Unplugged版)</span></p><span></span><p><span>02.张艾嘉 - 春望</span></p><span></span><p><span>03.周治平 - 筝</span></p><span></span><p><span>04.叶树茵 - 伤心无话</span></p><span></span><p><span>*图源自unsplash.</span></p><span></span><p><span>*所播放音乐作品版权归作品所有者。</span></p>]]></description>
