    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>歌曲名：城市（City is）</span></p><span></span><p><span>歌词：清源er</span></p><span></span><p><span>曲唱：suno(AI)</span></p><span></span><p><span>所谓机会 只是一场美梦</span></p><span></span><p><span>瞥见一只鱼的幻境</span></p><span></span><p><span>蔓延在泥泞之中</span></p><span></span><p><span>所谓自我 只是一具幽魂</span></p><span></span><p><span>附于任座城的金碧</span></p><span></span><p><span>消弥在苦笑意头</span></p><span></span><p><span>城市没有秘密</span></p><span></span><p><span>任何一个路人都是实境</span></p><span></span><p><span>包括你我自己</span></p><span></span><p><span>不问真心 放弃真实</span></p><span></span><p><span>太多伪装和道理 成为武器</span></p><span></span><p><span>挡住清晨所有光和影</span></p><span></span><p><span>开一盏灯</span></p><span></span><p><span>想问问自己</span></p><span></span><p><span>想问问上帝</span></p><span></span><p><span>活着的本我之义</span></p><span></span><p><span>该道别了 向这座城市</span></p><span></span><p><span>没有明天再见的轻语</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/662529a8f667d2f592da1c97/ljFaR9fClcLDIWFHLQWaRXpozz0v.m4a" length="5417325" type="audio/mp4"/>
